al languages, knowledge representation, expert systems and pattern recognition", "describe distributed systems, data and information security and intelligent web technologies", "explain the concept of big data analytics, purpose of studying it, issues that can arise with a data set and the importance of properly preparing data prior to a machine learning exercise; and", "explain the concepts, characteristics, models and benefits, key security and compliance challenges of cloud computing", "explain the physical and medical principles of biomedical instrumentation", "describe different types of electrical medical equipment", "analyse and solve problems related to the design of biomedical measurement instruments", "describe the underlying physical phenomena, architecture, employed materials, operational modes device/instrumentation", "identify and use basic biomedical instrumentation", "classify medical instruments based on different principles with application viz - (diagnostic, therapeutic, Imaging, analytical), physiological parameter and biopotential, biological system, in other departments in the hospital", "illustrate the different types of medical transducers used in medical instruments for body temperature, blood pressure, and respiration rate; and", "comprehend the physics of various biomedical transducers, such as electrodes, displacement transducers, thermocouples, thermistors, and flow meters", "comprehend biomaterials and tissue engineering terminology", "list different material types used in biomaterials and tissue engineering", "demonstrate a broad knowledge of materials science and engineering in biomedical applications", "examine physical properties, including degradation and mechanical properties of different kinds of biomaterials", "analyse biocompatibility and tissue-material interaction for different kinds of biomaterials", "determine the engineering properties of biomaterials", "apply the knowledge of engineering properties in the design of biomat