  ('f89d68fc-a20a-5dc4-bcfd-935b063cc349', 'e5fc1bb0-45a9-5551-ad53-b3cb017a7359', 'Mathematics, Economics, and any one of Chemistry, Physics, Biology or Geography', 'Five (5) SSC credit passes in Mathematics, English Language and three (3) other Science subjects.', '''A'' Level passes, ND/NCE at Credit/merit levels and HND lower credit in relevant programmes into 200 and 300 levels.'),
