  ('a2d41688-8ef2-5ff3-a6c0-cba7d4c2a7e6', 'f027f627-b4a8-5795-a941-15dc007c9bc3', 'History, and any other two (2) subjects from Arts and Social Sciences', 'Five (5) SSC credit passes to include History and English Language.', 'Two (2) ''A'' Level passes in History and any other related subjects.'),
