  ('13df116c-ecb8-50c2-a6f0-c17ef1976bb8', 'e1c071b0-e046-51f0-9de7-77ac53886688', 'dda275df-5e8f-50bc-8aba-27af698a4e74', '(iv) IBADAN accepts any two (2) ''A'' Level passes. | (iii) IBADAN requires five (5) ''O'' Level credit passes in Government/History, English Language and three (3) other subjects with at least ''O'' Level pass in Mathematics. | (iii) IBADAN - three (3) subjects in Arts, Science Social Sciences'),
  ('bac551b1-04ed-5113-82ee-5df86cd07d86', '308b7f5a-13c7-5fc0-8c29-5cac2ac5d469', 'dda275df-5e8f-50bc-8aba-27af698a4e74', NULL),
  ('89dbd4fe-b83d-595c-a04a-6a8e291ee86a', 'be4981eb-2b54-5ea1-941d-44e8ca2774db', 'dda275df-5e8f-50bc-8aba-27af698a4e74', '(ii) ILORIN accepts; a) At least two (2) `A'' level passes to include Government and any other Social Science subject. b) UNILORIN accepts own Diploma (Upper Credit) in Administrative Management plus UTME requirements. | (xxx) ILORIN requires five (5) `O'' level credit passes including English Language, Mathematics, Government and at least one other social science subjects. | (ii) ILORIN requires Government and at least one other Social Science subject.'),
