  ('df7ac320-e3c4-5236-ad46-cdebcaf2bb13', '0a012370-5686-58d1-8d4e-296446853862', '933d3bcc-fa7b-580b-8fdb-06715cfad66e', 'RSU in addition to ''O'' Level requirements accepts: (a) OND/ND (Upper Credit) relevant to the discipline. (b) HND (Lower Credit) relevant to the programme. (c) Degree (Third Class) relevant to the programme. (d) At least two (2) ''A'' level passes at GCE preferably in the Arts and Social Sciences. | UTME: RSU requires five (5) ''O'' Level credit passes to include English Language, Mathematics, Economics and any two (2) other subjects.'),
