  ('7efb4456-6bbc-57b5-b8e5-49ca06a9fa37', '2a117a94-b271-5351-a623-6616184fe452', '8e5dc67d-9b56-56c2-855b-65bdebcfb61c', 'Accepts (a) two (2) ''A'' Level passes with minimum of C grade in Mathematics, Physics, or Chemistry; or (b) at least Upper Credit pass in ND in Computer Science from a recognised Polytechnic; or (c) NCE with at least credit pass both in Computer Science/Mathematics, Computer Science/Physics or Mathematics/Physics.'),
  ('c9ed00ca-56b8-5296-91d2-bf1459595edd', '05eb9c1c-cd59-53b8-9e55-bf415b7ba4f5', '8e5dc67d-9b56-56c2-855b-65bdebcfb61c', NULL),
  ('6d13fdf5-7db5-53d1-a113-b096615ed8eb', 'a9560228-6453-5527-8eb6-9f5c346fabb0', '8e5dc67d-9b56-56c2-855b-65bdebcfb61c', 'Requires a) at least two ''A'' level passes not below Grade C in Mathematics and Physics; b) ND/HND at Upper Credit level in Physics, Chemistry, Mathematics, Statistics, Computer Science, Geology or Engineering; c) First Degree in Physics, Mathematics, Statistics, Chemistry, Geology or Engineering; d) Very good passes in three (3) JUPEB subjects namely Chemistry, Physics and Mathematics. Does not accept NCE.'),
