  ('3c79dcf6-9fbc-51ac-b291-beddeb408bea', '929f28a0-ddd3-5a6a-8e8f-90942af20ac0', '7cc8cb7b-c778-52e8-8203-a1cba35e5eba', 'AAU accepts ''A'' Level passes in Chemistry and Physics or Mathematics or Biology. | (xxiii) AAU accepts NCE merit in Chemistry and any other Science subject. | (vi) OAU and AAU accept any other subject in lieu of Biology.'),
