  ('44254fe7-8ca0-5f57-aeef-1177f5b71681', '363063fa-a46e-5ffa-82be-96d75945a3b9', '7cc8cb7b-c778-52e8-8203-a1cba35e5eba', '(lxv) FED-LOKOJA requires; a) For IJMB, two (2) `A'' Level passes in Chemistry and any other of Mathematics, Physics or Biology. b) For NCE, minimum of credit passes in Chemistry and either Biology/Physics/Mathematics. c) For OND, minimum of upper credit in Polymer Chemistry, Colour Chemistry, Science Laboratory Technology and Analytical Chemistry. d) Lower Credit in Polymer Chemistry, Colour Chemistry, Science Laboratory Technology and Analytical Chemistry. | (xxxiii) FED-LOKOJA requires five (5) ''O'' Level credit passes at not more than two (2) sittings to include English Language, Mathematics, Chemistry, Biology and Physics. | (xii) FED-LOKOJA requires Biology, Chemistry, Physics and Mathematics.'),
  ('4f6dfd4e-0d8b-58f4-baf6-91b220eda7b3', '7f1e09fa-66eb-50d0-b12b-a66eecc30366', '7cc8cb7b-c778-52e8-8203-a1cba35e5eba', 'FED-LAFIA accepts In addition to UTME requirements, DE candidates must have any of the following: IJMB: Minimum of 9 points ND: lower credit in Chemistry and any other relevant science courses /HND. NCE: Merit pass in NCE in Chemistry or any relevant subject. | (xliii) FED-LAFIA requires Five (5) Credit passes at SSCE, GCE, NECO and NABTEB O'' Level examination in Mathematics, English Language, Biology/Agric. Science, Chemistry and Physics in not more than two sittings. | (iv) FED-LAFIA, AUE, PHC and DELSU require Chemistry, Physics and Mathematics only.'),
  ('a29f031d-dbcc-53fc-b15f-37908f7a00c8', '4b767c85-a5d3-5578-b266-246db57463f3', '7cc8cb7b-c778-52e8-8203-a1cba35e5eba', NULL),
