  ('be945a6e-76e6-5ede-8828-3832cb20545d', 'accf0ac6-2d45-515e-99a3-226d5e64b71a', '7cc8cb7b-c778-52e8-8203-a1cba35e5eba', '(lxii) KASU accepts Two `A'' Level passes in Chemistry and any one of Physics, Mathematics and Biology. ND/HND/NCE with merit/ Lower Credit in related field in addition to `O'' Level requirements. IJMB/GCE `A'' Level with 7 points and above. | (xlv) KASU requires Five `O'' level credit passes to include English Language, Mathematics, Chemistry, Physics and one other Science subject. | (xxix) KASU requires Chemistry, Physics and one other Science subject. | KASU accepts Two ''A'' Level passes in Chemistry and any one of Physics, Mathematics and Biology. ND/HND/NCE with merit/ Lower Credit in related field in addition to ''O'' Level requirements. IJMB/GCE ''A'' Level with 7 points and above. | KASU does not accept Agricultural Science. | KASU requires Five ''O'' level credit passes to include English Language, Mathematics, Chemistry, Physics and one other Science subject. | KASU requires Chemistry, Mathematics, Physics and one other Science subject.'),
