  ('e2953317-b4ba-526f-bd86-a337adcf5b68', 'c38500f7-3bb8-54e1-9eff-3cfa8cdbf28e', '95470556-be8e-524a-84c9-c18631726722', 'Accepts IJMB/A level passes in Biology, Chemistry and any one of Mathematics, Physics or Agricultural Science; ND lower credit in Science Laboratory Technology and Food Science Technology. Candidate must also have five ''O'' Level credit passes in English Language, Mathematics, Chemistry, Biology and Physics.'),
