  ('e6f40cee-e7f9-5882-a5d3-a45c372cf040', '1f649dd9-1256-5e25-9cde-6fb9c81c80a6', '95470556-be8e-524a-84c9-c18631726722', NULL),
  ('3d6798b3-6419-5055-b4a0-1050ca267e41', 'b3b5ba8a-6573-57f7-b4f1-11c42e383729', '95470556-be8e-524a-84c9-c18631726722', 'In addition to UTME requirements accepts (a) ND upper credit/HND lower credit in Food Technology or Science Laboratory Technology; (c) NCE Merit with ''O'' Level credit pass in Biology. | For Science Laboratory Technology, in addition to UTME requirements, may accept two (2) ''A'' Level passes or its recognized equivalents at not more than two sittings; subjects should be of the Sciences.'),
  ('556a51de-6b7a-5abf-8974-9761891e3072', 'e8c6808a-0849-5b97-9a52-9ee5acde35cd', '95470556-be8e-524a-84c9-c18631726722', NULL),
  ('31d46c62-66bf-5962-95bf-14d7d7e51d8c', 'ef954b01-0ec7-50cc-a305-64443a125b58', '95470556-be8e-524a-84c9-c18631726722', 'Requires in addition to UTME requirements, two (2) ''A'' Level passes, NCE 3 merits or ND credit in relevant subject/programme.'),
