  ('1cf91bca-1242-5d12-bb39-2a6a6b0514d1', '874cb3e9-b034-5191-b74e-cb4647665403', 'a3ee8b52-f45a-562a-9f13-437e335f7229', NULL),
  ('55693645-5fb1-541f-bb5f-5f757378e9c0', 'e1c071b0-e046-51f0-9de7-77ac53886688', 'a3ee8b52-f45a-562a-9f13-437e335f7229', '(iii) BINGHAM and IBADAN require NCE/ND credit/merit in Mathematics and one (1) other approved Science subject.'),
  ('381f874e-528e-5ee0-9b55-c7fcae894e30', '2479d453-edec-5394-9b6c-d597957ece91', 'a3ee8b52-f45a-562a-9f13-437e335f7229', '(xvii) IGBINEDION accepts Physics plus one (1) of Mathematics or Chemistry, ND in Electrical/Electronics and Science Technology.'),
  ('15089dab-c814-598e-877c-344a98106525', 'be4981eb-2b54-5ea1-941d-44e8ca2774db', 'a3ee8b52-f45a-562a-9f13-437e335f7229', '(xii) ILORIN accepts; a) G.C.E. `A'' Level or equivalent (e.g. NCE.) in a minimum of two relevant science subjects (Mathematics and Physics). The NCE must be Distinction or Merit. b) `A'' Level passes in Chemistry and Physics plus `O'' Level credit in Mathematics and Biology.'),
  ('23a8f006-b6d8-5bc1-9d54-e3844cc821ea', '308b7f5a-13c7-5fc0-8c29-5cac2ac5d469', 'a3ee8b52-f45a-562a-9f13-437e335f7229', '(viii) ABSU and IMSU - No Direct Entry.'),
