  ('38888462-8c86-526c-b09c-3dce3269177c', 'accf0ac6-2d45-515e-99a3-226d5e64b71a', '66bf5d0f-7dd7-580e-9a1e-a42ffcd89cb4', 'Accepts Two ''A'' Level passes in Mathematics and Physics; NCE merit in Mathematics and any of Physics, Statistics, Chemistry; ND/HND Lower Credit in related field; IJMB/GCE ''A'' Level 7 points and above plus ''O'' Level requirements. UTME SUBJECTS: requires Mathematics, Physics and one other Science subject.'),
