  ('7c6275ef-0ced-5431-a65e-0771595bdd2e', '0b2a9d40-1151-53c2-afa0-dda8f622ef86', 'b71ed565-d14f-5c9b-9d3a-e87ba7673e46', 'UTME: requires two (2) other Science subjects.'),
  ('0cdb66f3-dc20-5b84-a60d-043b152e873f', 'd27d7d4c-dcf3-5254-9faa-94e2991a92e3', 'b71ed565-d14f-5c9b-9d3a-e87ba7673e46', 'DIRECT ENTRY: Two ''A'' level/IJMB passes which must include Geography and any other science subject (Biology, Chemistry, Physics, Mathematics, Agricultural Science and Economics) plus O/L requirements. UTME: Five ''O'' level credit passes in English Language, Mathematics, Geography, Biology and any other Science subject. UTME SUBJECTS: Use of English, Geography, Biology and any other science subject (Chemistry, Physics, Mathematics, Agricultural Science and Economics).'),
  ('4204b18c-11a5-50e5-8ed9-d454e7a9d4f3', '359901ac-970d-5d91-9eb3-dac88ae51d49', 'b71ed565-d14f-5c9b-9d3a-e87ba7673e46', NULL),
  ('035bad57-d6b4-56d5-aa6f-86cc39fdea41', 'a868159d-9676-5217-8e97-e9986cdcad57', 'b71ed565-d14f-5c9b-9d3a-e87ba7673e46', 'Does not accept Economics.'),
  ('a62ced5a-f949-5b9b-b0b2-5f412f113808', '8c9295db-6a52-50d5-a409-7821d70fd2cd', 'b71ed565-d14f-5c9b-9d3a-e87ba7673e46', 'Accepts Economics and Government (DE); accepts Economics (UTME).'),
  ('be92a825-0c19-5dcc-9f10-fd3d33110831', 'e1c071b0-e046-51f0-9de7-77ac53886688', 'b71ed565-d14f-5c9b-9d3a-e87ba7673e46', 'DIRECT ENTRY: accepts two (2) ''A'' Level subjects including Geography and any other Science subject for Geography. UTME: five (5) or six (6) ''O'' Level credit passes at one (1) or two (2) sittings to include English Language, Mathematics, Geography, and any two (2) other Science subjects. UTME SUBJECTS: Mathematics/Biology, Chemistry/Physics, Further Mathematics or Geography.'),
  ('3e0e5668-5c44-5c1b-9c5d-3082e8c8ad78', 'accf0ac6-2d45-515e-99a3-226d5e64b71a', 'b71ed565-d14f-5c9b-9d3a-e87ba7673e46', 'DIRECT ENTRY: Two ''A'' Level passes in Geography and any one of Economics, Physics, Chemistry and Biology. ND/HND/NCE Geography Lower Credit plus ''O'' Level requirements and IJMB with 7 Points. UTME: Five ''O'' level credit passes to include English Language, Mathematics, Geography and two other Science subjects; only accepts among Chemistry, Biology or Physics as the other two Science subjects. UTME SUBJECTS: Geography and two other Science subjects that may include Agric. Science.'),
  ('1089950c-ff9a-5195-904f-dc817bed3d57', '75621c96-8f52-5845-abef-3095b9bee383', 'b71ed565-d14f-5c9b-9d3a-e87ba7673e46', NULL),
  ('d885b7ae-9b3c-5b8a-817d-f46d49a5dd71', 'bbb4456a-842d-5c68-b8df-52431f4f22b8', 'b71ed565-d14f-5c9b-9d3a-e87ba7673e46', 'DIRECT ENTRY: accepts NCE merit, ND/HND upper or lower credit Meteorology.'),
  ('e46aaa49-a007-503d-ab52-a76af8d770b4', '97cc25e7-b0b9-542d-8da4-a78fa4f017bc', 'b71ed565-d14f-5c9b-9d3a-e87ba7673e46', NULL),
  ('d86b2f9c-95de-5fee-986f-907de913875b', '03d64828-505a-54d5-8a8c-7a95c177ddb1', 'b71ed565-d14f-5c9b-9d3a-e87ba7673e46', 'Accepts a minimum of 9 points in IJMB/HSC/GCE ''A'' Level/NCE in relevant subjects. All candidates must have Geography. UTME: Science Option- five (5) ''O'' level credit passes in English Language, Mathematics, Geography, and any two (2) of Chemistry, Physics, Biology and Agricultural Science. Social Science Option- English Language, Mathematics, Geography, and any two (2) of Government, Economics, Commerce and Accounting. UTME SUBJECTS: Geography and any other two (2) Science subjects; for Social Science, Geography and any other two (2) Social Science subjects.'),
  ('1b58cc8d-5271-577a-ae0e-2ad8deb1463a', '9ef6e1a9-1447-55f8-9de9-14a6844e1cff', 'a692ff81-1f9e-526d-a07b-f3dad21b728e', 'Accepts: a) Bachelor''s Degree in one (1) of Engineering, Mathematics, Statistics, Physics and Chemistry. b) NCE/ND/HND Lower credit in one (1) of Mathematics, Statistics, Physics and Chemistry. c) GCE ''A'' Level/IJMB/JUPEB Passes in Mathematics and one (1) of Physics, Statistics, Chemistry and Economics. UTME: requires Five (5) SSC credit passes in English Language, Mathematics and any three (3) of Further Mathematics, Physics, Chemistry, Biology, Economics and Geography. UTME SUBJECTS: requires Mathematics, Physics and one of Chemistry, Economics.'),
  ('18175738-0897-5482-a67e-4ac84c2bd1aa', '862dfbdf-bc8b-58e0-9031-c4c30cb2b315', 'a692ff81-1f9e-526d-a07b-f3dad21b728e', 'Accepts NCE, ND or HND in Statistics or related programme.'),
  ('ad54cea4-03f7-51e1-b1b7-756258931c0d', 'fe45832b-9a35-5f0b-bde4-8b7379a5c683', 'a692ff81-1f9e-526d-a07b-f3dad21b728e', NULL),
  ('3fb44331-250f-51cf-be8d-a1101c0e1fb6', 'bbb4456a-842d-5c68-b8df-52431f4f22b8', 'a692ff81-1f9e-526d-a07b-f3dad21b728e', 'Accepts NCE/ND/HND credit plus five (5) relevant UTME subjects. Requires Mathematics and Physics. UTME: accepts Technical Drawing. UTME SUBJECTS: accepts Geography and does not accept Biology.'),
  ('1f0c5d0f-47e2-59e4-93fa-780bf1af2002', 'dc4f0a5d-b0bd-5a7a-84e2-a4406fe8dfd8', 'a692ff81-1f9e-526d-a07b-f3dad21b728e', 'Accepts Economics and ND/NCE in Mathematics/Statistics.'),
