  ('bf2adb92-d803-549d-8e5b-bef8080cc7b3', 'e7c05fd4-6b0d-50f2-9179-d7c7be0a45a1', '265e08d0-c76a-5667-a596-b2ee306d36bc', '(ii) OAUSTECH requires (a) Two (2) ''A'' Level passes in Biology, Chemistry or Physics. (b) ND distinction and credit in relevant subjects. | UTME (i) OAUSTECH requires five (5) ''O'' Level credit passes in English Language, Mathematics, Chemistry, Biology and any one (1) of Agricultural Science, Physics and Geography. | UTME SUBJECT (i) OAUSTECH requires Biology, Chemistry and any one (1) of Mathematics, Physics and Agricultural Science.'),
  ('1c13f448-8961-5cb3-8693-02335716c428', '26ce26b0-5eac-5286-b8b5-179e56a6b320', '265e08d0-c76a-5667-a596-b2ee306d36bc', 'DIRECT ENTRY (i) LAGOS accepts Very good passes in the following three (3) JUPEB subjects: Biology, Chemistry and Physics. Does not accept NCE/HND. (iv) LAGOS accepts (a) very good passes in the following three (3) JUPEB subjects: Biology, Chemistry and Physics. (b) LAGOS does not accept NCE/HND. | UTME (ii) LAGOS requires Five O/Level credit passes in English Language, Mathematics, Biology, Chemistry and Physics. | UTME SUBJECT (ii) LAGOS requires English Language, Biology, Chemistry and Physics.'),
