  ('6389ed15-216d-53df-aff2-4339a3378808', 'f90909a4-fcc6-5899-a1a5-dd43ce3cbbc8', '68604374-fc17-5739-8049-80ec9aaf8941', 'DIRECT ENTRY: (a) ''A'' Level passes in Mathematics and Physics or its equivalent and three (3) other ''O'' level credit passes; (b) ND upper credit or its equivalent in Surveying from an NBTE accredited institution; (c) Bachelors Degree in the Physical Sciences and Engineering programmes. UTME: five ''O'' Level credit passes including Mathematics, Physics and other Science subjects. ''O'' Level credit pass in Geography is compulsory. UTME SUBJECTS: Geography and any two (2) subjects preferably Arts or Social Science subjects.'),
