  ('6546f8c1-a41d-5a58-9f5e-7afa57dccbab', 'e1c071b0-e046-51f0-9de7-77ac53886688', '234fbf45-219c-5a51-9ecd-3a80e12083b5', 'IBADAN and UMUDIKE accept ND or HND in the related fields. IBADAN Agricultural candidates must apply to read Agriculture until 500 level when options will be available.'),
