  ('9db602d7-2c85-5021-ba5c-4f3ab3fd2cf4', 'be4981eb-2b54-5ea1-941d-44e8ca2774db', '234fbf45-219c-5a51-9ecd-3a80e12083b5', 'ILORIN accepts ND/NCE credit pass in Agriculture into 200 level while those with HND may be admitted into 300 level. Also accepts NCE merit in Biology, Chemistry or Agriculture, and ND merit in Banking/Finance, Business Management plus UTME requirements.'),
  ('53e902d5-666e-5615-81a8-b39b41a08a36', '308b7f5a-13c7-5fc0-8c29-5cac2ac5d469', '234fbf45-219c-5a51-9ecd-3a80e12083b5', 'IMSU - accepts ND/NCE Double Major or HND in Agriculture or related disciplines with at least a merit pass into 200 level and HND (Upper Credit) into 300 level.'),
  ('d923a28b-189b-512b-bf5f-1fd98356b29b', '03d64828-505a-54d5-8a8c-7a95c177ddb1', '234fbf45-219c-5a51-9ecd-3a80e12083b5', NULL),
