  ('b53fba83-aa01-57df-8129-563720768964', '3d100db0-f83d-5c8c-95aa-39430c981f86', '70598e3b-6f76-53f1-9ceb-fe642f4a67b3', NULL),
  ('bfa543fc-d52f-5723-9954-c8bc1a43fed6', '2eeb38d3-f2b6-5e5f-8495-08af1af1d88e', '70598e3b-6f76-53f1-9ceb-fe642f4a67b3', 'EBSU accepts a) two (2) ''A'' level passes in Chemistry and one of Zoology/Botany/Agric science/Biology, Agricultural science and other science subjects. b) NCE with minimum merit passes in relevant subjects. c) HND and ND with minimum of upper credit in relevant program. | UTME: Same as in Soil Science.'),
