  ('27ef4557-eaae-5281-b4ed-7a2132e3c23d', '9462539f-d63e-59e0-84d5-82dfb6184f69', '6196aabe-520c-5134-a797-cd77382a52d6', 'Accepts ND upper credit or NCE credit in Hospitality and Tourism, Catering Management, Hotel Management, Home Economics from a recognized Institution in addition to the UTME requirements.'),
  ('8b235935-c901-5def-8953-27bbcfd535aa', 'be4981eb-2b54-5ea1-941d-44e8ca2774db', '6196aabe-520c-5134-a797-cd77382a52d6', 'Requires at least ''A'' Level pass in Physics, accepts NCE with relevant five (5) ''O'' Level credit passes. Accepts candidates with ''O'' Level pass in Biology, but who have ''O'' Level credit passes in Agricultural Science, Food & Nutrition/Home Management.'),
