  ('fbea0501-5b86-5e26-adfd-708670d82104', 'e1c071b0-e046-51f0-9de7-77ac53886688', '741a0349-529e-56fc-a0a0-476c8beb47d5', 'IBADAN accepts ''A'' Level passes in any two (2) Arts subjects. UTME: IBADAN requires five (5) ''O'' Level credit passes at one sitting or six (6) ''O'' Level credit passes at two (2) sittings to include English Language, History, Literature in English, Government, Geography, Religious Studies, Economics, Biology, Hausa/Igbo/Yoruba.'),
  ('c16e8e6d-2ce6-5b87-a62b-418fa51841e5', 'e6c3392c-accc-5515-a9ce-560b9790aede', '741a0349-529e-56fc-a0a0-476c8beb47d5', 'JOS accepts NCE Merit or ND lower credit. UTME: JOS requires five (5) ''O'' Level credit passes to include English Language, History/Government, Geography and any Social Sciences/Arts subjects.'),
  ('483b33e9-d0b6-5a6a-aa6d-b081d4646147', 'f90909a4-fcc6-5899-a1a5-dd43ce3cbbc8', '741a0349-529e-56fc-a0a0-476c8beb47d5', 'UNN requires a) two (2) ''A'' Level passes or ND/HND credit or NCE merit plus the UTME requirements b) Candidates combining Archaeology with Science/Social Sciences must satisfy the requirements in the respective programmes. UTME: UNN requires five (5) ''O'' Level credit passes to include English Language and any Science subject as well as ''O'' Level pass in Mathematics or its equivalent. UTME SUBJECTS: UNN accepts any three (3) subjects.'),
  ('9316eefb-5179-526e-a251-a96ced7c1061', '8b7d04ad-16d7-540d-86a4-543f02e79e54', '741a0349-529e-56fc-a0a0-476c8beb47d5', NULL),
