  ('827d4f80-b66e-5f9e-9c16-72fc29a4b59a', '511f36cd-22bd-5e2a-accf-432b24ea59dd', '826d263c-6052-567a-b845-ee74ceea58c3', 'Direct Entry: requires ''A'' Level passes in French and Government or History and any other Arts or Social Science subject. | UTME: requires five (5) ''O'' Level credit passes or its equivalent in English Language, Government or History and any other three (3) subjects. | UTME Subjects: requires Government or History plus any other Arts Subjects.'),
