  ('a2ac40ac-2116-5248-b5d2-aa794bfd5e9e', 'f90909a4-fcc6-5899-a1a5-dd43ce3cbbc8', '826d263c-6052-567a-b845-ee74ceea58c3', 'Direct Entry: accepts a) NCE merit in two (2) relevant subjects as well as the UTME requirements; b) Two (2) passes at GCE ''A'' Level/HSC or its equivalent, DALF certificate or an acceptable Baccalaureate Certificate in relevant subjects. | UTME: requires/accepts for a) French Single Honours, minimum five (5) ''O'' Level credit passes to include French, English Language, one science subject and two (2) other Arts subjects one of which must be Literature in English; b) German Single Honours, minimum five (5) ''O'' Level credit passes including English Language, one science subject and three (3) other Arts subjects one of which must be Literature in English (Goethe Institute language proficiency certificate an advantage); c) French with German/Russia, ''O'' Level credit passes to include English Language, French, one science subject and two (2) other Arts subjects one of which must be Literature in English; d) candidates successful in its one year preparatory programme in French, minimum score of 40% plus UTME requirements.'),
