  ('0375b071-b890-55c6-bcae-35a32f443cd1', 'd567a2a1-0e09-50e6-a549-8ebc1a86367d', 'c32f0818-9755-5cfe-b6ce-ca3016646aff', NULL),
  ('41d223c4-977c-553b-8fd2-590056c42cde', 'cc548faf-07a4-5541-93c3-535da80d4d5e', 'c32f0818-9755-5cfe-b6ce-ca3016646aff', 'Direct Entry: accepts ND/Accredited Diploma in any of the following disciplines: Pol. Science, Public Admin., Local Government, Law, Public Policy, Mass Communication at Credit passes or NCE with at least 9 points. | UTME: requires Five credit passes at SSCE (or its equivalent) in English, Mathematics, Government or History and any two of IRS/CRS, Economics/Commerce, Geography, Literature in English, Languages (Arabic, French, Hausa, Igbo, Yoruba and Fulfulde). | UTME Subjects: requires Government and any two of IRS/CRS, Economics/Commerce, Geography and Literature in English.'),
  ('78e0a45f-005c-5250-a22f-d4eaccf4f761', '363063fa-a46e-5ffa-82be-96d75945a3b9', 'c32f0818-9755-5cfe-b6ce-ca3016646aff', 'Direct Entry: accepts, in addition to meeting the UTME Entry Requirements, 2 ''A'' Level passes to include History/Government & one other Arts or Social Science; NCE credit pass in minimum of 3 major subjects; ND upper credit in Pub. Adm. & LG Studies or other cognate courses; HND lower credit in Pub. Adm. & LG Studies or other cognate courses; Degree (Third Class) in Law or Education Courses & Arts, Soc. Sci. Courses. | UTME: requires Five (5) SSC credit passes to include English Language, Government/History plus two (2) Social Science subjects and any other subject. A credit in Mathematics is compulsory. Note: Civic Education is considered as part of Government and so will not count in reckoning. | UTME Subjects: accepts History/Government plus one Social Science subject and any other Arts or Social Sciences subject. Note: Civic Education cannot be taken in lieu of Government.'),
  ('fd41a02c-3607-5bc7-adf8-b065041e12ba', 'cf90707a-389f-5ef7-9550-3e51de569ee2', 'c32f0818-9755-5cfe-b6ce-ca3016646aff', NULL),
  ('dda839d6-c301-5a6c-995e-c416da0a641b', '494e4fb9-006d-55e9-86f2-caf559cdfb7d', 'c32f0818-9755-5cfe-b6ce-ca3016646aff', 'Direct Entry candidates must obtain Two ''A'' Level passes in Government/History/Economics/CRK/IRK/Commerce at GCE A/L, IJMB or Advanced NABTEB or a Merit pass at NCE in relevant subjects or at least a credit at OND/HND or a First Degree in relevant field from an approved University. Candidates must also satisfy the minimum O/L requirement for admission. | UTME: Five (5) credits at not more than two sittings including English Language, Mathematics, Government/History/Civic Education and any two of the following: Economics, Geography, CRK/IRK, Literature in English, Commerce obtained from SSCE, NECO, NABTEB or its equivalent. | UTME Subjects: requires Government/History and any two of CRK/IRS, Economics, Literature in English, Geography or Commerce.'),
  ('bea874ae-7483-552e-94c0-d91c20867c27', 'bf0a9b2b-9fd6-5e7e-9c88-6c372119fa86', 'c32f0818-9755-5cfe-b6ce-ca3016646aff', NULL),
