  ('11a764e8-a404-5418-a3a4-f7c7e9cb9bc6', '43eded73-d8ee-57da-ba48-e8ea86c8fc90', 'ee6c4763-c0ae-5a38-90c8-a80b33b7da83', 'MAUTY accepts HND pass or ND lower credit in Building or any relevant programmes. | MAUTY requires ''O'' Level credit passes in Physics and any other two (2) subjects from Building Construction, Geography, Economics, Technical Drawing, Further Mathematics, Biology, Chemistry, Plumbing and Pipe Fitting/Electrical installation and Maintenance work/Block laying, Brick laying and concrete work, painting and decoration.'),
  ('0c1450f3-a55f-5787-9228-f91b4e2eb64a', 'bbb4456a-842d-5c68-b8df-52431f4f22b8', 'ee6c4763-c0ae-5a38-90c8-a80b33b7da83', 'MINNA requires English Language, Mathematics, Physics and any two (2) from Chemistry, Geography, Economics, Fine Arts, Technical Drawing, Building Construction, Biology. | MINNA requires Physics, Mathematics and any one from Chemistry, Geography, Biology, Economics or Arts (UTME subjects).'),
