  ('f2d30cb7-b30b-5fe6-8db0-f77e763b3892', 'be4981eb-2b54-5ea1-941d-44e8ca2774db', '3e390e0b-2452-52e3-90d3-9be42da6b6fc', 'A candidate who fulfills UTME requirements and holds a HND Certificate in Architectural Technology from NBTE accredited Polytechnic or College of Technology passed at Upper/Lower credit level may be considered for admission into 200 level. | Requires five (5) credits in English Language, Mathematics, Physics, Technical Drawing/Fine Art and any one other from Geography, Building Construction, Land Surveying, Further Mathematics. | UTME subjects: Mathematics, Physics and any one of Fine Arts, Technical Drawing, Geography, and Building Construction.'),
  ('a78ccb81-d931-5926-a1b4-3f7a3a23fae1', '308b7f5a-13c7-5fc0-8c29-5cac2ac5d469', '3e390e0b-2452-52e3-90d3-9be42da6b6fc', 'Requires ''A'' Level passes in Mathematics and Physics and accepts NCE credit in relevant subjects.'),
  ('87596c16-f965-516a-93d4-58f6cbf8b340', 'bfdc5e48-20b3-5e9d-b4f7-3b1ab0d35bc3', '3e390e0b-2452-52e3-90d3-9be42da6b6fc', 'Accepts five (5) ''O'' Level credit passes in relevant subjects plus ND upper credit. | Requires five (5) ''O'' Level credit passes in English Language, Physics, Mathematics, Chemistry and any one of Geography, Fine Arts, Woodwork, Technical Drawing, Biology or Economics plus ND upper credit in relevant programmes.'),
  ('da14bc9a-5fe5-5b40-adec-f29bc3aaff22', 'c27891b7-8253-58e6-af12-6bfb123e151b', '3e390e0b-2452-52e3-90d3-9be42da6b6fc', NULL),
  ('18a64c3b-bf70-5655-bdd2-ea2d3f449a33', 'e6c3392c-accc-5515-a9ce-560b9790aede', '3e390e0b-2452-52e3-90d3-9be42da6b6fc', 'Accepts five (5) ''O'' Level credit passes including English Language, Mathematics, Physics, Technical Drawing or five (5) Arts or Applied Arts and one (1) of History, Economics, Geography and Chemistry.'),
  ('f781d4e5-59f3-54b4-9782-9b050b2ed48a', '634db0e8-6dcf-5af7-8eb2-7e4a24f14213', '3e390e0b-2452-52e3-90d3-9be42da6b6fc', NULL),
  ('af839113-704b-5b75-a3a5-505157954bf3', 'accf0ac6-2d45-515e-99a3-226d5e64b71a', '3e390e0b-2452-52e3-90d3-9be42da6b6fc', 'Accepts two ''A'' Level passes in Mathematics/Physics and Chemistry; ND/HND Lower Credit in related field and IJMB 7 points and above in addition to ''O'' Level requirement. | Requires five ''O'' level credit passes including English Language, Mathematics, Physics, Chemistry and any of Economics and Technical Drawing. | UTME subjects: Mathematics, Physics and Chemistry.'),
  ('0739e2c0-30d7-58f5-b9da-a785b6a47f72', 'b1b4fc19-3e74-5955-bddd-ac63ab9e1ad6', '3e390e0b-2452-52e3-90d3-9be42da6b6fc', NULL),
  ('45e46dbb-c626-5738-8a4d-24f4580b05f4', '79afe82f-07d2-52f3-96e4-70085bb0f0c9', '3e390e0b-2452-52e3-90d3-9be42da6b6fc', 'Runs the programmes for a four (4) year duration for UTME and three (3) year duration for DE; may consider HND upper credit or degree (Third Class) in Architectural Technology for special admission into 300 level.'),
  ('57de3402-432c-5590-957c-df31ba3d9d76', '26ce26b0-5eac-5286-b8b5-179e56a6b320', '3e390e0b-2452-52e3-90d3-9be42da6b6fc', 'Requires very good passes in JUPEB/A'' Level subjects: Mathematics, Physics and Visual Arts; minimum of lower credit in HND/ND in Architecture with good credit in Architectural Portfolio assessment into 200 level. | Requires five O''Level credit passes in English Language, Mathematics, Physics, Fine Arts or Technical Drawing and any one of Economics, Geography, Chemistry, Biology, Painting and Decoration/Building Construction. | UTME subjects: English Language, Mathematics, Physics and any one of Chemistry, Geography, Economics, Biology, Fine Arts.'),
  ('4a802af9-2954-5c8f-afa9-3793d4641c64', '4208cf5b-56b9-56ab-809d-9d17f1f3488d', '3e390e0b-2452-52e3-90d3-9be42da6b6fc', NULL),
  ('03ce2b2b-36ba-586a-90d7-7d529c5d59c6', 'f27c9b51-bb13-5d3a-b5d1-6ec9ab637161', '3e390e0b-2452-52e3-90d3-9be42da6b6fc', NULL),
  ('3f6d2611-05ab-5003-81bb-f2b1b30ea35f', '49133bab-9c43-5b01-89b0-5e2dde1b8969', '3e390e0b-2452-52e3-90d3-9be42da6b6fc', 'Accepts a) ''A'' Level passes in two (2) subjects and any of Physics, Chemistry, Geography, Fine Arts and Mathematics; b) ND/HND upper credit in Architecture for admission into 200 level. | Accepts ''O'' Level credit pass in Technical Drawing or Fine Arts in lieu of Biology.'),
  ('ed9b16a6-b261-5d5e-9759-d2b6fc2bdc8b', '2ad5a1cd-7c4a-5d35-a882-ca7417d9d6bd', '3e390e0b-2452-52e3-90d3-9be42da6b6fc', 'Requires ''O'' Level credit passes in English Language, Mathematics, Geography and any other two subjects.'),
  ('81f7eb9f-6742-541d-be5c-014ace2e967e', '86a98670-0550-5087-b911-faf373001caf', '3e390e0b-2452-52e3-90d3-9be42da6b6fc', NULL),
  ('1e0f142a-cbd8-5dcd-b8c4-cb609dbd81b5', 'eb2b773f-8ee4-5799-ac95-143c6394f4d9', '3e390e0b-2452-52e3-90d3-9be42da6b6fc', NULL),
  ('acd8d3bb-435d-5ebc-835e-3bbd3e75a6e3', 'b85995c1-4fe5-5833-896c-e58f8ae25106', '3e390e0b-2452-52e3-90d3-9be42da6b6fc', NULL),
  ('c6aeeff6-d1a8-548f-887c-ed947c198315', '43eded73-d8ee-57da-ba48-e8ea86c8fc90', '3e390e0b-2452-52e3-90d3-9be42da6b6fc', 'Accepts ND/HND minimum of Lower credits in Architecture, Civil Engineering, Quantity Surveying and any other relevant field. | Requires five (5) SSC credit passes in English Language, Mathematics, Physics and any two of Chemistry, Fine Art, Visual Art, Geography, Economics, Technical Drawing, Further Mathematics. | UTME subjects: Physics, Mathematics, and any of Chemistry, Geography, Art, Biology and Economics.'),
  ('6aba0a3e-e026-5f6b-b04e-93b2be497c85', 'bbb4456a-842d-5c68-b8df-52431f4f22b8', '3e390e0b-2452-52e3-90d3-9be42da6b6fc', 'Accepts candidates who have undergone an accredited course in Architecture in approved Colleges of Technology or Polytechnics in addition to UTME requirements.'),
  ('7c10005e-eb31-5fd7-9d9c-799421ff38c8', 'b159c585-6d14-5ae7-88f5-1aa90fd54e1c', '3e390e0b-2452-52e3-90d3-9be42da6b6fc', NULL),
