  ('c7978689-ba30-59f6-9766-25af0db3a1c2', '0a012370-5686-58d1-8d4e-296446853862', '3e390e0b-2452-52e3-90d3-9be42da6b6fc', 'Admission to Year II with HND (Lower Credit) in appropriate discipline or OND/ND (Upper Credit) in relevant discipline; at least two (2) ''A'' level passes at GCE in Physics and Mathematics, plus UME entry requirements; Admission into Year III with HND (Upper Credit) in appropriate discipline. | Requires five (5) WASC/GCE/SSCE/NECO ''O'' level credit passes in Physics, English Language, Mathematics and any two subjects from Geography, Technical Drawing, Further Mathematics, Fine Arts, Chemistry. | UTME subjects: Mathematics, Physics and any other subject from Chemistry, Geography, Fine Arts.'),
