  ('d7e1577f-8b6e-5a0a-871f-9353c3ac82a3', '511f36cd-22bd-5e2a-accf-432b24ea59dd', '3e390e0b-2452-52e3-90d3-9be42da6b6fc', 'Requires five (5) ''O'' Level credit passes including English Language, Mathematics and Physics and any two from Technical Drawing, Chemistry, Geography, Fine Arts, Economics and at least ''O'' Level pass in Chemistry. | UTME subjects: Mathematics, Physics and any one of Chemistry, Geography or Technical Drawing.'),
