  ('0bbbd028-cf09-5405-98e3-db22bfeed13b', 'd27d7d4c-dcf3-5254-9faa-94e2991a92e3', '110f0f00-248d-548f-96af-729032651e11', 'Requires a) ''A'' Level/IJMB passes in Geography and one of Economics/Mathematics. b) ND upper credit in Urban and Regional Planning or related Environmental Sciences from accredited institutions. c) HND lower credit in URP or related Environmental Sciences. Also accepts ND lower credit plus UTME requirements. | (UTME) Requires five (5) ''O'' Level credit passes in English Language, Mathematics, Geography and any other two (2) from Economics, Technical Drawing, Fine Arts, Chemistry and Biology.'),
