  ('08b637db-8684-589d-a9c4-271338c7cbf0', '862dfbdf-bc8b-58e0-9031-c4c30cb2b315', '110f0f00-248d-548f-96af-729032651e11', NULL),
  ('b35930c2-409b-5b47-9f9f-17c5c455d529', 'b2c7e8cf-ee09-5ad3-8156-921b71bdcacd', '110f0f00-248d-548f-96af-729032651e11', 'Accepts a) ''A'' Level/IJMB relevant subjects. b) ND/HND lower credit in Urban and Regional Planning or allied programmes may be admitted to the appropriate level. | (UTME) Requires two (2) other subjects from Science or the Social Sciences. UTME subjects: Mathematics, Physics and any of Chemistry/Biology/Geography.'),
