  ('46d7a8d0-e376-539e-9326-d1583f7c3b41', '2a117a94-b271-5351-a623-6616184fe452', '110f0f00-248d-548f-96af-729032651e11', 'Accepts a) GCE ''A'' Level passes in CIE, IJMB, JUPEB examination or equivalent in at least two (2) of Mathematics, Geography, Economics, Physics and Chemistry at minimum of Credit passes. b) ND at Upper Credit in Town Planning and related subjects. | (UTME) Requires five (5) SSC credit passes or equivalent at a maximum of two (2) sittings in English Language, Mathematics, Geography and any two subjects from Chemistry, Biology/Agric. Science, Economics, Technical Drawing. At least a pass in Physics is required. UTME subjects: Mathematics and any two from Physics, Chemistry, Economics and Geography.'),
  ('dced8743-d87a-59d5-81ce-50dce835a4d7', 'a9560228-6453-5527-8eb6-9f5c346fabb0', '110f0f00-248d-548f-96af-729032651e11', 'Requires a) At least three ''A'' level passes not below Grade C in Mathematics, Geography and one of Physics or Chemistry. b) ND/HND at Upper Credit in Physics, Mathematics, Statistics, Computer Science, Geology, Environmental Sciences or Engineering. c) First Degree in same fields. d) Very good passes in three JUPEB subjects: Mathematics, Geography and any of Chemistry, Biology, Physics, Economics, Technical Drawing and Fine Arts. Does not accept NCE. Candidates must meet ''O'' Level requirements. | (UTME) Requires at least five (5) ''O'' Level credit passes in English Language, Mathematics, Geography, Physics and any one of Biology, Fine Arts, Technical Drawing, Chemistry and Economics in not more than two (2) sittings. UTME subjects: Mathematics, Geography and any of Physics, Chemistry, Biology, Economics, Technical Drawing and Fine Arts.'),
  ('396668da-16a0-5193-b170-7827de10fdd5', 'f3d31093-b900-5185-a4ef-b3dbb37cb373', '110f0f00-248d-548f-96af-729032651e11', NULL),
