  ('da4ace84-32a2-5c05-91a7-0eea704cbb44', 'be4981eb-2b54-5ea1-941d-44e8ca2774db', '75fab7c6-ba39-5972-ac57-11f241524d92', 'For Educational Technology/Introductory Technology requires: (a) NCE Merit in Arabic, Christian Religious Studies, English Language, Fine and Applied Arts, French, History, Islamic Studies or Nigerian Languages, or any three relevant subjects in IJMB/JUPEB; (b) NCE Merit in Biology, Chemistry, Computer Science, Health Education, Human Kinetics, Integrated Science, Mathematics, Physics, Technology Education, and ND Lower Credit in A-V Technology, Electrical/Mechanical/Civil Engineering/Woodwork/Metallurgical, Computer Science or Mass Communication; (c) NCE Merit in Accounting, Economics, Geography, Political Science or Social Studies. Minor subject from Direct Entry list; Unilorin Diploma in Instructional Radio & Television Production and Diploma in Photography acceptable. For Technology Education accepts NCE (Technical)/ND/ANTC with Lower Credit in all fields of Engineering and Technology, NCE Merit in Physics/Computer/Integrated Science/Chemistry/Biology, or IJMB/JUPEB with Physics, Chemistry or Biology.'),
