  ('7a7b5485-6ddc-59fe-8588-874727d55189', '0a0013b5-4b5a-5144-a156-8d2db266ce65', '3c95dfd2-0e7a-5429-9c2b-7ee392b980f2', 'UTME: five ''O'' Level credit passes to include English Language, Mathematics, Biology or Chemistry and any two other subjects.'),
  ('b3a04f33-9192-5459-88b1-6f1cb4b6b8a5', 'd27d7d4c-dcf3-5254-9faa-94e2991a92e3', '3c95dfd2-0e7a-5429-9c2b-7ee392b980f2', 'Accepts ''A'' Level passes/IJMB in two (2) of Chemistry and any of Biology, Botany or Agricultural Science. UTME: five ''O'' Level credit passes in Mathematics/English Language/Home Economics, Biology, Geography, Physics/Chemistry; Old Grade II five passes including Arithmetic/English Language/Domestic Science; New Grade II five credit passes including English Language, Mathematics and Home Economics; one Home Economics subject (Foods and Nutrition, Home Management or Textile and Clothing) is required.'),
  ('12d00a36-bd9c-5bdb-88e1-ea52062734c8', '1f7547ec-2119-5820-a300-5e1e25ab0898', '3c95dfd2-0e7a-5429-9c2b-7ee392b980f2', 'UTME: ''O'' Level credit passes in Chemistry, Mathematics, and any two of Food and Nutrition, Home Economics/Home Management, Clothing and Textile, Agricultural Science/Biology.'),
  ('aab58696-be0e-5593-9234-de76a783b37b', '359901ac-970d-5d91-9eb3-dac88ae51d49', '3c95dfd2-0e7a-5429-9c2b-7ee392b980f2', NULL),
  ('ae688589-c5a9-5847-a2b0-6804443e52c0', 'd3814c09-9bb5-5e5c-8c17-4fb24d235f6f', '3c95dfd2-0e7a-5429-9c2b-7ee392b980f2', NULL),
  ('78fe383b-7351-5f0c-9e71-2a5d65536cc3', 'b3b5ba8a-6573-57f7-b4f1-11c42e383729', '3c95dfd2-0e7a-5429-9c2b-7ee392b980f2', 'Requires two (2) or three (3) merit in NCE including Home Economics plus three (3) or two (2) ''O'' Level credit passes in English Language, Biology/Agricultural Science with ''O'' Level pass in Chemistry. UTME: ''O'' Level pass in Chemistry and credit pass in Biology/Agricultural Science. UTME subjects: Biology/Agricultural Science and any other two Science or Social Science subjects.'),
  ('5465282a-950e-50bf-a39f-91580d3902d9', '80fa8795-5ba9-5984-8fe2-c09146280362', '3c95dfd2-0e7a-5429-9c2b-7ee392b980f2', NULL),
  ('bf81ebc9-20d2-5601-b887-21428243bccb', '2a323993-11a4-5569-905d-e90b89ee3bc7', '3c95dfd2-0e7a-5429-9c2b-7ee392b980f2', 'Direct Entry: preliminary degree candidates from Benue State University only must pass at least five of six subjects at 50%; NCE use of English acceptable in lieu of ''O'' Level English; ''A'' Level pass in acceptable subjects; upper credit ND/HND or Diploma in Fashion and Clothing Management Education or Home Economics plus credit in two of Home Management, Clothing and Textiles, Food and Nutrition, Biology, Chemistry, Agricultural Science and Economics; NCE (Home Economics Education) merit with credit in four of the same; any other qualification considered appropriate by BSU. UTME: ''O'' Level credit passes in English Language, Mathematics, Biology and any two of Home Management, Clothing and Textiles, Food and Nutrition, Chemistry, Agricultural Science and Economics at WASSCE/SSCE/GCE ''O'' Level/NTC/NBC. UTME subjects: Biology, Chemistry, and any one of Mathematics, Physics, Economics, Agricultural Science.'),
  ('9dbc53c1-635c-5f44-86c2-945651bec140', 'dc4f0a5d-b0bd-5a7a-84e2-a4406fe8dfd8', '3c95dfd2-0e7a-5429-9c2b-7ee392b980f2', NULL),
  ('5b1c1e9f-4039-590f-8037-3d48538b71db', 'f4a20ad9-1a91-57ce-a90f-fee5c89b0c99', '3c95dfd2-0e7a-5429-9c2b-7ee392b980f2', NULL),
  ('c209bafa-267c-510a-8922-46e855c7f2a5', '32ed37ab-c7e4-5072-af80-ce3659ab6a7b', '3c95dfd2-0e7a-5429-9c2b-7ee392b980f2', 'Requires NCE in Home Economics with minimum merit pass, OND Home Economics or Food Science in upper credit or any other related courses. UTME: five credits at SSC or equivalent including English Language, Mathematics, Biology, Chemistry and Home Economics or Food Nutrition. UTME subjects: Biology or Agricultural Science or Chemistry, Home Economics or Food and Nutrition and any one of Mathematics and Economics.'),
  ('bfedcd24-9f2c-5573-a9bf-9970b9032986', '2eeb38d3-f2b6-5e5f-8495-08af1af1d88e', '3c95dfd2-0e7a-5429-9c2b-7ee392b980f2', 'Accepts NCE merit or ND/HND upper credit respectively in the relevant programme. UTME: five ''O'' Level credit passes in English Language, Mathematics and any three of Biology, Chemistry, Physics, Food and Nutrition, Clothing and Textile, Home Management. UTME subjects: a Social Science subject as the third subject.'),
  ('6e1fc550-b9b3-5a17-a9e1-de0ee9e5b2a2', 'd80980df-4da8-5d52-b9f5-a5180944b365', '3c95dfd2-0e7a-5429-9c2b-7ee392b980f2', NULL),
  ('add4bd63-7025-5505-97fe-d12d4d4bc120', '34e2a282-8a88-507b-a0d5-ac7e4b9f99bf', '3c95dfd2-0e7a-5429-9c2b-7ee392b980f2', NULL),
  ('f5d500fb-0880-5d12-a9cc-516329ecb9f0', 'd9e4f750-65c2-5f1c-b539-fcb22b5537d9', '3c95dfd2-0e7a-5429-9c2b-7ee392b980f2', 'UTME: ''O'' Level credit passes in Biology and Chemistry.'),
  ('1dfe3c22-a332-51ec-bf81-c5c1f7017375', '062f65ad-bfa9-5a12-90d6-7ab2764ffeac', '3c95dfd2-0e7a-5429-9c2b-7ee392b980f2', 'UTME subjects: Biology or Agricultural Science and any two Science or Social Science subjects.'),
  ('6046d7ff-3ab9-570f-a137-9f03ef413d25', '93abddd6-b6d8-56b9-8abe-69499671d8f8', '3c95dfd2-0e7a-5429-9c2b-7ee392b980f2', 'Accepts NCE merit/HND/ND lower credit in Fashion and Clothing Management Education or Home Economics or Hotel and Catering or Home and Rural Economics plus the UNN UTME requirements. UTME: five ''O'' Level credit passes including English Language and any two of Home Management, Clothing and Textile, Food and Nutrition, Biology, Chemistry, Agricultural Science and Economics. UTME subjects: Chemistry or Biology plus two other Science subjects.'),
  ('1dfe339e-8627-5735-b33a-5c5c29652006', '3af60c0f-6921-5e79-b812-34a7a392a4b2', '3c95dfd2-0e7a-5429-9c2b-7ee392b980f2', NULL),
  ('4d44976e-0045-5b39-ba71-d321ad58a89d', '919048fb-f8b2-554b-a994-ce7c389beca4', '3c95dfd2-0e7a-5429-9c2b-7ee392b980f2', 'Requires three (3) ''A'' Level passes/NCE in Home Economics; NCE credit in Home Economics including Education.'),
