  ('45b42acd-9bc3-5810-8f8a-b7925a790136', 'd2a71257-e069-5599-9db4-3e9a8a81f80f', '3c95dfd2-0e7a-5429-9c2b-7ee392b980f2', NULL),
  ('356f72d8-ac43-5c05-bf9e-63cd35363dc9', 'a86474c7-df4a-5753-ac4c-1eaff8590231', '3c95dfd2-0e7a-5429-9c2b-7ee392b980f2', NULL),
  ('258cc553-abca-5350-92fc-e851eedbb3a6', '26ce26b0-5eac-5286-b8b5-179e56a6b320', '3c95dfd2-0e7a-5429-9c2b-7ee392b980f2', 'Accepts NCE or ND in Home Economics, Catering and Hotel Management, Textile Management and any other relevant subject with minimum merit pass; very good passes in three JUPEB subjects (Chemistry, Biology and one other from Home Economics, Physics, Food & Nutrition, Home Management, Clothing & Textile); three ''A'' Level passes in two relevant Science subjects; ND with Distinction in Hotel Management, Tourism, Catering and Hotel Management. UTME: five O/Level credit passes in English Language, Mathematics, Chemistry, Biology/Agricultural Science and one of Economics, Home Economics, Physics, Food & Nutrition/Home Management, Clothing and Textile, Garment Making/Dyeing & Bleaching/Catering Craft Practice. UTME subjects: English Language, Chemistry, Biology/Agricultural Science and one other from Mathematics, Physics, Food & Nutrition, Home Management, Clothing & Textile, Garment Making, Dyeing & Bleaching, Catering Craft Practice.'),
  ('565ac546-84c5-5eea-9b4c-e1cf60b59ba7', '6acc7e9b-fb80-52c0-87fd-6f18bc1ae726', '3c95dfd2-0e7a-5429-9c2b-7ee392b980f2', NULL),
  ('32ef36ec-5bf7-5644-9d5f-ec653295e16c', '43eded73-d8ee-57da-ba48-e8ea86c8fc90', '3c95dfd2-0e7a-5429-9c2b-7ee392b980f2', 'Accepts NCE merit in Home Economics, A Level passes in two (2) of Chemistry or any Biology, Botany and Agricultural Science, and ND/HND credit in Home Economics or Food Science or Hotel and Catering Management or related programme. UTME: five O Level credit passes including English Language, Mathematics and any three of Biology/Agric Sc., Home Management, Food and Nutrition, Clothing & Textiles, Economics, Geography, Chemistry, Physics, Health Education, Catering & Craft Practice, Garment Making, Textile Trade, Marketing/Salesmanship, Cosmetology; or NTC/NBC credit passes or TCII Merit including English and Mathematics. UTME subjects: Biology/Agricultural Science and any two of Home Economics/Management, Economics, Chemistry, Physics.'),
  ('a1d513fa-a748-5784-bef6-d472f9920088', '4123353a-92fc-5b20-aaff-ef69ccbf47b6', '3c95dfd2-0e7a-5429-9c2b-7ee392b980f2', NULL),
