  ('48d4c9a1-7fcb-5883-a416-48d858b43169', '03d64828-505a-54d5-8a8c-7a95c177ddb1', 'c5b9b282-1e38-5454-ba42-2fe58f8caf04', 'Direct Entry: accepts a minimum of 9 points in IJMB/HSC/GCE ''A'' Level/NCE. Candidates with a minimum of lower credit pass in Diploma/HND in Library and Information Science from recognized institutions may also be admitted. | UTME: requires five ''O'' Level credit passes at SSC or equivalent in English Language, Mathematics and three other subjects at not more than two sittings.'),
