  ('5068e092-9e57-520b-9aba-1eae44cf6f35', 'f90909a4-fcc6-5899-a1a5-dd43ce3cbbc8', 'c5b9b282-1e38-5454-ba42-2fe58f8caf04', 'Direct Entry: accepts candidates holding either (a) NCE merit in Library and Information Science or the subject being combined with it, or (b) HSC/''A'' Level in two subjects including that to be combined with Library and Information Science. | UTME: requires UTME requirements with five ''O'' Level credit passes including the subject to be combined with Library and Information Science, plus additional ''O'' Level credit requirements for particular combinations.'),
