  ('3794a797-a0ae-5279-a766-39e24d94ba92', 'f90909a4-fcc6-5899-a1a5-dd43ce3cbbc8', '24855e23-ce1c-56ee-9e46-ca07bc5b1805', 'Accepts (a) two (2) ''A'' Level passes plus the UTME requirements; (b) NCE merit in Business Education plus the UTME requirements; (c) ND lower credit in Secretarial Studies/Administration from any recognized polytechnic plus the UTME requirements; (d) full Technical Certificate/National Secretarial Examination Certificate at ''A'' Level in Business Studies plus the UTME requirements. | UTME: Requires ''O'' Level credit passes in five (5) subjects which must include English Language, Mathematics and any three (3) of the following: Economics, History, Commerce, Financial Accounting, Typewriting, Government, Geography, Physics and Chemistry. | UTME subjects: Requires Mathematics, Economics, plus one (1) of Commerce, History, Government, Geography, Chemistry or Physics.'),
  ('708a1d53-7354-5822-a7c7-5afd69eaa86a', '03d64828-505a-54d5-8a8c-7a95c177ddb1', '24855e23-ce1c-56ee-9e46-ca07bc5b1805', NULL),
  ('12685ca8-2ee6-5791-a180-a6cd2f56512d', 'befc2692-df13-522c-a855-087cf72d6486', '24855e23-ce1c-56ee-9e46-ca07bc5b1805', NULL),
  ('6b324053-85ad-54e4-ba3b-34e035e966f8', '76561787-b77a-53e2-a65c-22d345d89260', '24855e23-ce1c-56ee-9e46-ca07bc5b1805', 'Accepts NCE, ND upper credit, HND lower credit in relevant programmes plus the UTME requirements. | Accepts a) NCE in relevant subject(s) or overall merit pass or above; b) Advanced level GCE or Advanced level NABTEB or JUPEB passes in two (2) relevant subjects; c) National diploma (minimum of lower credit level) in any area related to Business Education. | UTME: Requires five (5) ''O'' Level credits which must include English Language, Mathematics in WASC, SSCE/NECO/GCE ''O'' level NABTEB and any three (3) of Business Education and Social Science subjects at not more than two (2) sittings. NOTE: Biology Education or Agric in place of Physics can be considered.'),
  ('d12e101e-e50b-501f-ae3e-52d27f863871', '82191620-27f8-59df-a08e-e53415df52b9', '24855e23-ce1c-56ee-9e46-ca07bc5b1805', NULL),
  ('b9fb176f-b421-55d9-afe9-80f75061ff5f', '50be92fa-ae92-53e9-8cb5-ebe8c4683f43', '24855e23-ce1c-56ee-9e46-ca07bc5b1805', NULL),
  ('c0f3c1be-cca2-57d1-9372-9da9c894020b', '350804fe-9a29-530c-bd7f-079a786f5bd7', '24855e23-ce1c-56ee-9e46-ca07bc5b1805', 'Accepts Two (2) A Level passes or NCE merit in two (2) relevant subjects; NCE merit in Business Education Double Major; At least Lower Credit in ND Business Administration/Management, Marketing, Accountancy, Banking & Finance and Office Technology Management. | UTME: Requires Five (5) TC II merit, O Level or NTC/NBC credit passes including English Language, Mathematics, Economics and two (2) other subjects in the Social Sciences or Arts. For NBC, the other subjects could be from any of Commerce, Office Practice, Principles/Financial Accounting, Secretarial/Clerical Office Duties, Typewriting, Shorthand, Book Keeping, Business Management, Government/History/Civic Education, Information & Communication Technology, Salesmanship/Marketing, Store Keeping/Management, Type writing and Stenography. | UTME subjects: English Language, Mathematics, Economics plus one (1) other subject from Commerce, Office Practice, Principles/Financial Accounting, Secretarial/Clerical Office Duties, Typewriting, Shorthand, Book Keeping, Business Management, Government, History, Civic Education, Information & Communication Technology, Salesmanship, Marketing, Store Keeping/Management, Type writing and Stenography.'),
